        "work": "Walden; Civil Disobedience",
        "source_url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/205",
        "source_language": "en",
        "source_label": "Henry David Thoreau",
        "source_detail": "Civil Disobedience. Original: It is truly enough said that a corporation has no conscience; but a corporation of conscientious men is a corporation with a conscience."
      },
